<< /Type /StructElem /S /Figure /P 16 0 R /Pg 4 0 R /Alt (Line graph of how many months of savings D65 has on hand, 2027 to 2037. With the District's other cuts but both schools open, savings run out in 2033. The District's plan, which closes Dewey and Lincolnwood, runs out in 2034, one year later. With both schools open plus better options, savings stay above the three-month safety cushion until about 2033 and last through 2037. Adding a 2028 referendum keeps savings near ten months by 2037.) /A << /O /Layout /BBox [50.25 326.3 561.75 447.4] /Placement /Block >> /K 37 >>
